{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter-planck","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:substrate-parameter-planck","kind":"definition","title":"Substrate parameter and quantum Planck constant","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-frobenius-hopf-substrate"],"tags":["substrate-parameter","planck-constant","q-deformation"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.SubstrateParameterPlanck","text":"substrate-parameter-planck.md","leanSource":"substrate-parameter-planck.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:substrate-parameter-planck\"></a><p>The <strong>substrate parameter</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in \\mathbb{C}^*</code> is the deformation parameter of the Frobenius--Hopf algebra <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>. The <strong>quantum Planck constant</strong> associated to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">\\hbar_q =  1 - q^{-1} =  \\frac{q - 1}{q}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/substrate-parameter-planck.md","heading":"Definition","number":"4.10.6","page":"b/def-substrate-parameter-planck","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":67},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.AlgebraicSubstrate.SubstrateParameterPlanck","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/substrate-parameter-planck.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
